      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47: from about 16:30 to 17:00 I was at the workshop; around 17:05 I passed through the square; around 17:11 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:20 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:26 I passed through the square; from about 18:30 to 19:30 I was at the Lantern.",
