      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47: from about 16:30 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:05 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at the Holm house; around 19:18 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 19:30 I was at the Lantern.",
