      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47: from about 16:30 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at the Harrow house; around 18:06 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 19:30 I was at home.",
