      "key": "K0512",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 47: from about 16:30 to 16:30 I was at the square; from about 16:30 to 17:00 I was at home; around 17:04 I passed through the square; from about 17:00 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:15 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 19:30 I was at the Lantern.",
      "time": 67227,
